  "legalLastUpdated": "Last Updated: August 2025",
  "legalContactTitle": "Contact Us",
  "legalContactBody": "If you have any questions about this policy, please contact us at:\nsupport@mahwar.app\nOr call our support line: 19000",
  "legalTermsIntro": "Welcome to Mahwar, the roadside emergency services app. By using this application, you agree to the following terms and conditions that govern the relationship between you and the Mahwar platform.",
  "legalTermsSection1Title": "Acceptance of Terms",
  "legalTermsSection1Body": "By using the Mahwar app, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these terms. If you do not agree to any of these terms, please do not use the application.",
  "legalTermsSection2Title": "Acceptable Use",
  "legalTermsSection2Body": "The application may only be used for lawful purposes and in accordance with applicable laws in Egypt. Use of the application for any fraudulent, harmful, or inappropriate purpose is strictly prohibited.",
  "legalTermsSection3Title": "Accounts & Responsibility",
  "legalTermsSection3Body": "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials and password, as well as all activities occurring under your account. You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account.",
  "legalTermsSection4Title": "Nature of App Services",
  "legalTermsSection4Body": "Mahwar provides a digital platform connecting car owners with emergency service providers. We are not a party to the agreement between the client and the provider, and we are not responsible for the quality of services rendered.",
  "legalTermsSection5Title": "Pricing & Payments",
  "legalTermsSection5Body": "All payments are made directly between the car owner and the service provider. The app facilitates the price negotiation and acceptance process. The application does not collect any commission or fees from transactions.",
  "legalTermsSection6Title": "Cancellation & Rejection",
  "legalTermsSection6Body": "Car owners may cancel requests at any time before accepting the price. Service providers may reject requests before submitting a quote. Once the price is accepted by the client, the order is considered binding.",
  "legalTermsSection7Title": "Intellectual Property",
  "legalTermsSection7Body": "All intellectual property rights in the app, including designs, logos, and content, are reserved to Mahwar. No part of the application may be reproduced or used commercially without prior permission.",
  "legalTermsSection8Title": "Amendments to Terms",
  "legalTermsSection8Body": "We reserve the right to modify these terms and conditions at any time. Users will be notified of any material changes through the application. Continued use of the app after modifications constitutes acceptance of the changes.",
  "legalPrivacyIntro": "At Mahwar, we value your trust and are fully committed to protecting your personal data. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information.",
  "legalPrivacySection1Title": "Data We Collect",
  "legalPrivacySection1Body": "We collect data necessary for providing our services, including: full name, phone number, email address, live GPS location, national ID (for service providers), and vehicle details (make, model, year). We do not collect any unnecessary data.",
  "legalPrivacySection2Title": "How We Use Your Data",
  "legalPrivacySection2Body": "We use your data for the following purposes: providing emergency services, connecting you to the nearest service providers geographically, sending notifications related to your requests, improving app quality and user experience, and ensuring platform security.",
  "legalPrivacySection3Title": "Data Sharing",
  "legalPrivacySection3Body": "We do not share your data with third parties except in the following cases: when necessary to provide the service (sharing your location with the selected service provider), legal obligation by competent government authorities, or with your explicit consent.",
  "legalPrivacySection4Title": "Data Security",
  "legalPrivacySection4Body": "We use the latest encryption and security technologies to protect your data. We rely on Supabase as a secure infrastructure with SSL/TLS encryption for all communications. Row Level Security (RLS) policies are applied to ensure no unauthorized access to your data.",
  "legalPrivacySection5Title": "Your Data Rights",
  "legalPrivacySection5Body": "You have the following rights regarding your data: right to access and view your stored data, right to correction and modification, right to delete your account and all data, and right to object to data processing in certain cases.",
  "legalPrivacySection6Title": "Location Data",
  "legalPrivacySection6Body": "We use location data only during active service request sessions to find the nearest providers. We do not track your location in the background outside of service requests. You can control location permissions from your phone settings at any time.",
  "legalPrivacySection7Title": "Data Retention",
  "legalPrivacySection7Body": "We retain your account data as long as your account is active. Upon account deletion, all your personal data is deleted within 30 days. We may retain some anonymized data for statistical analysis.",
  "legalPrivacySection8Title": "Policy Updates",
  "legalPrivacySection8Body": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for operational or legal reasons. We will notify you of any material changes via an in-app notification before the changes take effect.",
